Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://csbc.bihar.gov.in/A-REP.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;CSBC Bihar Prohibition Constable Exam City Details 2026 : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e When will the\u003cstrong\u003e Bihar Prohibition Constable Exam 2026 be conducted?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003e The examination date has announced officially by the \u003cstrong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"256\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eCentral Selection Board of Constable\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e (CSBC)\u003c/strong\u003e through the official portal\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Where can I check the\u003cstrong\u003e exam city notice?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates can check the exam city notification on the official CSBC website under the \u003cstrong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"446\"\u003e“Notice Board”\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"476\"\u003e“Latest Notifications”\u003c/strong\u003e section.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e In what format will the\u003cstrong\u003e exam city notice be released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The notification is generally released in \u003cstrong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"611\"\u003ePDF format\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e When will the \u003cstrong\u003eadmit card be released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer: The admit card is usually released a few days before the examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website for \u003cb\u003eCSBC \u003c/b\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website for \u003cb\u003eCSBC \u003c/b\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://csbc.bihar.gov.in/A-REP.htm.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-35252 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Of